<title>FRANCE: France outlines bids for EU wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>France outlines bids for EU wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>European grain exporters made the following free-market bids through France at this week's EU tender, French cereals office (ONIC) said. Bids for refunds are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Sept 19---	    --- Sept 12 ---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids  Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat  379,250   0.74-13.97    407,600    0.47-10.00</p>
<p> Barley	 94,000   24.92-29.87   165,000    24.79-24.97</p>
<p>ACP TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat   15,000   7.20-9.97	72,800    5.25-11.80</p>
</text>
